{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f829a1c42a6fa379","type":"text","text":"You go upstairs to your tooms. After everything that happened today you manage to fall fast asleep. You get some strange dreams.\n- About a scholar teaching a young prince the ways to lead a kingdom\n- You dream about a young man getting lost on a battlefield\n- You dream about two kids stealing food from the streets\n- And about a man and a woman teaching their daughter how to wield a bow \n","x":111,"y":-295,"width":809,"height":215},
		{"id":"8e4d4014fed81edb","type":"text","text":"Dream","x":-260,"y":-217,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9762f8ff5c647b78","type":"text","text":"Wake up\n","x":-260,"y":125,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ea4f5f75cd2b1e3f","type":"text","text":"You wake up to find you are no longer in your room but inside a temple. \nWalls made of white marble with small gaps where rays of light come through. \nA long red rug with candles along side it point to an altar with a statue behind it.\nYou hear the dripping sound that echoes through the temple followed by a tssshhhh sound. ","x":140,"y":80,"width":780,"height":150},
		{"id":"5316700e48469127","type":"text","text":"Altar","x":-269,"y":543,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"394f2e66a6bfe4e6","type":"text","text":"If they come closer to the altar\nAs you come closer to the altar you can see the details of the statue, it depitcs a man slicing his hand, his blood falling from the cut feeding the brazier bellow it\nOn top of the altar there's a closed book covered in blood stains and charred corners","x":111,"y":513,"width":800,"height":120},
		{"id":"d131701168b1ef47","type":"text","text":"If they open the book wisdom check 10","x":1092,"y":533,"width":498,"height":50},
		{"id":"b32db9517531fedb","type":"text","text":"SUCESS\nThe pages are full of bloodstains and parts of the pages are burnt off but you can see its a records of sorts, from the little thats left you read about \n- [[Niels]] a king sending all abled men to the frontlines of defence\n- [[Nikolai Oak]] a man picking up a contract to hunt a bear\n- [[Seraphim the lost]] a man gathering soldiers for a rebelion\n- [[Rin and Machi]] and a young boy and girl joining a gang","x":611,"y":756,"width":760,"height":231},
		{"id":"0a190e6e7015b421","type":"text","text":"FAIL\nbut many of the words are covered by bloodstains or burnt off","x":1451,"y":756,"width":677,"height":84},
		{"id":"59b48eb049688ca1","type":"text","text":"At the end of the book theres an undamaged page where you can read the words\n- Relinquish thy blood or forfeit thy blade to the flame\nAs you finish reading the page starts burning off, covering the room with smoke.\nAs the room clear you see that the book has dissapeared and five daggers have appeared on top of the altar. \nYou notice that the blood dripping from the hand has come to a stop and the flame bellow it has grown weak","x":871,"y":1158,"width":820,"height":220},
		{"id":"377182265ae6267e","type":"text","text":"If they take their god damn time","x":1371,"y":1558,"width":290,"height":50},
		{"id":"35ee9d30423a511e","type":"text","text":"You feel the temple shake and a voice echoing through the walls\nThe flame demands tribute","x":1760,"y":1553,"width":561,"height":105},
		{"id":"cca98209eb31a5ed","type":"text","text":"When they decide to sacrifice","x":791,"y":1718,"width":310,"height":50},
		{"id":"54d724d0c77571e3","type":"text","text":"As your INSERT THING falls into the brazier you see the flame sparkle, shinning a bit brighter","x":760,"y":1880,"width":341,"height":100},
		{"id":"7245f8cddbab0158","type":"text","text":"After everyone sacrifices","x":790,"y":2046,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a4d470aac1b5efc3","type":"text","text":"The fire starts to die out, in the ashes there are X scrolls with WHATEVER NAMES on it","x":791,"y":2280,"width":489,"height":120},
		{"id":"f5f854557f6e2b92","type":"text","text":"\n[[Nikolai Oak]]\n\t\tSee the blood running through your hands\n\t\tBid your farewell to the ones you love\n\t\tTheir grief but a fleeting feeling\n\t\tFor nature is calling \n\t\t\n\n[[Niels]]\n\t\tNumb lost in time  \n\t\tHears whispers of a world in an endless night\n\t\tCling to comfort child, no longer\n\t\tThere's nowhere left to run, nowhere left to hide\n\n[[Seraphim the lost]]\n\t\tTears of the father, blood of the son  \n\t\tThrough years of dishonor, come undone\n\t\tFeel the ancient ones guiding your sword  \n\t\tLet fly all your fears and respond to the call\n\t\t\n\n[[Rin and Machi]]\n\tRin\n\t\t\tYou felt the light and it felt good\n\t\t\tJourneyed away, far from that place\n\t\t\tAnd prayed, none would know you\n\t\t\tIn the shadow of the light\n\tMachi\n\t\t\tFaced with the dark, forced to chose  \n\t\t\tThose shadows led you astray\n\t\t\tYou want the world to forget\n\t\t\tThe memory of darker days\n\t","x":1460,"y":1980,"width":620,"height":900},
		{"id":"22d687716d7e49e3","type":"text","text":"Readings","x":-280,"y":2310,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cdeabceec7aab14f","type":"text","text":"Final boss","x":-280,"y":2837,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d13affe877d4b4da","type":"text","text":"You start hearing something hitting hard at the temple doors, with each hit the door splinter a bit. Fog starts coming in from the wall gaps from where the light once came\n\nThe door gives in and from it comes a massive beast like humanoid creature, its body covered in black fur with horns sprouting from his back wielding a battle axe. Roll initiative\n\nHis body begins to dissolve. The room gets flooded with a thick warmer fog and you become overwhelmed with memories","x":400,"y":2760,"width":699,"height":214},
		{"id":"1aeb726fedd9331e","x":629,"y":3066,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[4 Epilogue.canvas]]"}
	],
